+ *   words[0] = PBESTATE_STATE_WORD0 in the low dword, STATE_WORD1 in the high one
+ *   words[1] = PBESTATE_REG_WORD0   (memory layout, stride, channel swizzles)
+ *   words[2] = PBESTATE_REG_WORD1   (size/clip words; zero for a linear target)
+ *
+ * A fragment stream built without them configures no render target at all - the PBE slots are
+ * zeros - and the firmware cannot run the fragment job. Returns false for formats whose PBE
+ * packmode this function does not encode rather than emitting a plausible wrong one. */
+bool pvr_csb_pbe_words(enum pipe_format format, uint64_t addr, uint32_t mrt_index,
+                       uint32_t stride_bytes, uint64_t words[3]);
